  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Kosovo Compact - AMERICAN CATALYST FACILITY FOR DEVELOPMENT Project: The American Catalyst Facility for Development Project aims to promote additional private-sector investments in Kosovo&#xFFFD;s energy sector in collaboration with the U.S. International Development Finance Corporation (DFC) by complementing MCC&#xFFFD;s funding and leveraging private sector participation to scale a successful energy storage public entity launch and catalyzing complementary renewable energy investments that bolster renewable energy generation capacity.</narrative>
